WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.875
Your turn.

2
00:00:01.155 --> 00:00:13.187
You now have every building block: how models generate and why they vary (week 1), prompts you can test (week 2), structured outputs you verify (week 3), and tool calls with gates (week 4).

3
00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:20.037
The Studio 1 project asks you to assemble them into this feature, make your own design choices, and defend them.

4
00:00:20.317 --> 00:00:28.616
Start with the definition of done, collect your transcripts, and build the thinnest version that runs end to end before you improve any one stage.
